cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below, and cite the accompanying paper."
type: software
title: "gastrohun-frozen-cnn-vit-benchmark"
abstract: >
  Reproducibility code for a benchmark of frozen CNN and Vision Transformer
  (ViT) backbones as feature extractors, coupled with an SVM classifier, for
  multi-class anatomical endoscopic image classification on the GastroHUN
  dataset. Includes feature extraction, nested cross-validation, SVM
  hyperparameter search, Friedman/Nemenyi statistical testing, and generation
  of the tables and figures reported in the associated paper.
